Package: vtamR
Title: Validation and Taxonomic Assignment of Metabarcoding Data with R
Version: 2.0.0
Date: 2026-11-18
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Emese", 
           family = "Meglecz", 
           email = "emese.meglecz@imbe.fr", 
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-7547-4858"))
Description: A rewrite and extension in R of VTAM (Gonzalez et al. 2023) 
    <doi:10.1016/j.csbj.2023.01.034>. 'vtamR' enables modular, control-calibrated 
    validation of metabarcoding occurrences and supports reproducible 
    biodiversity assessment and long-term monitoring. It is adaptable to 
    diverse experimental designs and objectives. It provides functions to 
    handle and analyze metabarcoding datasets, including wrappers for 
    external tools such as 'VSEARCH', 'BLAST', 'Cutadapt' and 'Swarm', with 
    support for pipeline execution and result parsing.
